 menu, its search and the ways back

fixup! Wave 1, taps: a second tap does one thing; the menu, its search and the ways back

- The check-in's way back carried one page further is a quiet line at the bottom, under the named way back to the page
  just behind (Needs attention is named), and it is the phone's Back over the page between (data-back="1"): the
  check-in at its spot, the history not grown. The top keeps one way back, the bar's. The entry keeps the trail in
  history.state, so Back after a look at the Dashboard draws it again.
- Every page that is in the app opens by its address (a soon page as its plain placeholder, a builder's page after the
  view switch); only an address that names no page says Page not found.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FKTjPFbzEx2ZvP4BhqKEiS
